[5] Proof readout
  1. The AP-tail family S_m={1,...,12,m} is completely discharged
     by the q=13 puncture clock plus the fixed-point tail clock.
  2. The two S193 coarse-stalk residuals are not new F7 debt.  They
     are controlled-kernel examples: mod-14 owner geometry collided,
     and the missing coordinate was exactly m mod 13.
  3. HYP-3031's zeta repair class for these teeth is nested
     refinement with an owner-strip witness: the quotient may forget
     the mixed coordinate only after proving the AP-tail formula.
  4. New LRC14 target: identify other large automatic-fiber residuals
     that are just AP-core plus one or two tail punctures, then prove
     the same reciprocal fixed-point certificate before invoking
     heavier Fejer/THM-572 machinery.
